# A caller asking pi for one line, which is `ctx.ui.input`. The same kind of
# stop as the dialog next door — same extension, same tool call gated — and a
# screen amx said nothing about until there was a rule for it. The agent is
# still there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is driving this scenario
# decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen input
sleep 600000
